  "id": "irish-cream-coffee-layer-cake",
  "name": "Irish Cream Coffee Layer Cake",
  "subtitle": "Moist chocolate-coffee cake with a mascarpone cream topping",
  "description": "A two-layer chocolate cake enriched with coffee and finished with a cocoa mascarpone frosting flavored with Irish cream liqueur.",
